# Upstox sync for the Weinstein/RRG dashboard — Oracle VM cron (times IST; set the
# VM/crontab TZ to Asia/Kolkata). Runs BEFORE the repo's GitHub Actions build
# (21:00 IST weekdays) so the build reads fresh Upstox ratios.
#
#   crontab -e   and paste the line below (edit the path to your checkout).
#
# 20:00 IST, Mon–Sat: options + FII/DII every run; fundamentals refresh on Sat.
0 20 * * 1-6 cd /home/ubuntu/weinstein-rrg-nse-dashboard && PYTHON=/usr/bin/python3 upstox_sync/deploy/run_sync.sh >> upstox_sync/deploy/cron.log 2>&1
#
# The Upstox token expires ~03:30 IST daily and Upstox has no headless login.
# Refresh it before 20:00 with:
#   cd /home/ubuntu/weinstein-rrg-nse-dashboard && python3 -m upstox_sync login <redirect-url>
# (or automate token refresh with your preferred method / share the token that the
#  paper-trader / stock360 job already refreshes on this same VM).
